run_etl_pipeline()
├── EXTRACT
│   ├── GET /genre/movie/list
│   └── for each page (1–3):
│       ├── GET /discover/movie?region=SG
│       └── for each movie in results:
│           └── GET /movie/{id}  (with delay)
├── TRANSFORM (per detail response)
│   ├── Parse JSON → derive fields (date, bool, stringified list)
│   ├── Build Movie, Genre, MovieGenre Python objects
│   └── Stage objects with session.add()
└── LOAD
    ├── session.commit() for genres
    └── session.commit() for movies + bridge records
